**Summary:**
The contributions of the paper: 

1) study the drawbacks of cross-entropy loss in the global attack of GNNs and propose alternative losses;

2) propose a scalable attacking algorithm based on the randomized block gradient descent algorithm. It also introduces a heuristic to enforce sparse adjacent matrix and avoid the computation on dense matrix;

3) propose a more efficient defense method based on an existing method, Soft Medoid.
